      "writtenOn": "2024-03-18T14:38:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It might also be worth mentioning here that removing your battery will no longer disable write protect automatically. This goes with the AP RO verification change. Users will need to either disabled wp or make wp follow battery presence (through `gsctool --wp` command). Also worth noting that the `gsctool --wp` will guide the user to enable `AllowUnverifiedRO` CCD cap if not already enabled when trying to change write protect setting.",
